<title>USA: Cambridge Partners moves to new address.</title>
<headline>Cambridge Partners moves to new address.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cambridge Partners said it has moved effective Monday, May 19.</p>
<p>The new address is 535 Madison Ave, 19th Floor, New York, N.Y., 10022</p>
<p>The firm's telephone and fax numbers remain the same. The telephone number is (212) 508-6565. The FAX number is (212) 508-6575.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
